1
00:00:59,280 --> 00:01:00,799
This is the truth behind the Li mansion hauntings.

2
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:02,840
The six of us worked together

3
00:01:03,479 --> 00:01:04,319
just to punish

4
00:01:04,359 --> 00:01:06,079
the killer of Elder Ding and his grandson.

5
00:01:06,239 --> 00:01:07,439
That's a vicious lie!

6
00:01:08,079 --> 00:01:10,120
That I hurt Elder Ding and his grandson...

7
00:01:10,959 --> 00:01:11,840
Tell me this.

8
00:01:12,120 --> 00:01:13,959
He was just a dirt poor old man.

9
00:01:14,079 --> 00:01:15,159
Why would I bother hurting him?

10
00:01:15,239 --> 00:01:15,680
You...

11
00:01:19,359 --> 00:01:19,920
Jiang Huai,

12
00:01:20,719 --> 00:01:21,280
tell us.

13
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:22,719
What was his motive for murder?

14
00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:27,319
Go get the box.

15
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:28,319
The box is in the Li mansion's storeroom.

16
00:01:28,319 --> 00:01:28,840
Madam!

17
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:30,280
Jiang Huai is just a storyteller.

18
00:01:30,359 --> 00:01:31,519
Storytellers love making things up.

19
00:01:31,519 --> 00:01:32,120
Shut up!

20
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:33,560
My dad was bought off by you,

21
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:34,239
but I wasn't.

22
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:35,799
Watch your mouth.

23
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:36,879
Don't make me smack you.

24
00:01:37,519 --> 00:01:38,239
Benefactor Li,

25
00:01:40,879 --> 00:01:41,719
Master Li.

26
00:01:42,799 --> 00:01:43,920
You're obviously afraid of ghosts,

27
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:45,959
so why do you still live in this mansion?

28
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:50,599
Rumor has it

29
00:01:51,799 --> 00:01:53,000
that the Li mansion has bad Feng Shui.

30
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:55,560
Every wife you marry dies.

31
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:58,599
But with so many good Feng Shui spots,

32
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:01,040
why did you seize Elder Ding's land

33
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,239
to build your mansion here?

34
00:02:04,079 --> 00:02:06,079
I believe your real reason

35
00:02:08,159 --> 00:02:09,919
lies in this jade pendant of yours.

36
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:10,639
Don't move!

37
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:12,560
What about the jade pendant?

38
00:02:13,199 --> 00:02:14,000
Look closely, everyone.

39
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:16,960
The pattern on this jade pendant

40
00:02:17,439 --> 00:02:18,280
is called the Flowing Cloud Pattern.

41
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:21,759
It's exclusive to Yuncang Kingdom royals.

42
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:23,280
Yuncang Kingdom,

43
00:02:24,039 --> 00:02:25,280
because it was rich in gold,

44
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:27,240
was also known as the Kingdom of Gold.

45
00:02:27,439 --> 00:02:27,960
Master.

46
00:02:30,919 --> 00:02:31,879
Here, from the Li mansion's storeroom,

47
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,240
we found these Yuncang Kingdom artifacts.

48
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:36,199
Master said

49
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:38,400
these are all burial goods from a tomb.

50
00:02:39,759 --> 00:02:40,199
Don't move!

51
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:41,360
What are you doing? Don't move!

52
00:02:41,639 --> 00:02:42,159
Two years ago,

53
00:02:43,159 --> 00:02:45,159
you appeared near Elder Ding's house.

54
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:46,560
He treated your injuries,

55
00:02:46,719 --> 00:02:48,520
yet you plotted against his family.

56
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:50,400
All for

57
00:02:50,919 --> 00:02:53,120
the Yuncang Kingdom's Golden Tomb, right?

58
00:02:55,719 --> 00:02:57,400
Actually, you're not Benefactor Li at all.

59
00:02:59,039 --> 00:03:01,240
You go by a much more notorious name.

60
00:03:02,439 --> 00:03:03,919
You're Burrowing Rat.

61
00:03:04,919 --> 00:03:07,159
One of the famous Four Bandits of Yanbei.

62
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:10,479
News of your tomb raiding

63
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:12,319
often appeared in the newspapers.

64
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:15,039
I've been keeping an eye on you all along.

65
00:03:16,039 --> 00:03:18,400
The Four Bandits of Yanbei were infamous

66
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:20,800
and made front-page headlines every time.

67
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,400
However, two years ago,

68
00:03:23,039 --> 00:03:24,400
they suddenly vanished without a trace,

69
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:26,039
and committed no more crimes.

70
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:29,199
Until I first saw Benefactor Li,

71
00:03:30,159 --> 00:03:31,400
and noticed his enlarged knuckles

72
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:32,319
and darkened neck.

73
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:34,800
These are signs of years of hard labor.

74
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:37,199
But why would a wealthy master

75
00:03:37,719 --> 00:03:39,159
do physical labor?

76
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:40,560
Later on,

77
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:42,560
Both in the storeroom and on him,

78
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:44,479
I found treasures of the Yuncang Kingdom.

79
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:46,560
The one who digs for the Four Bandits

80
00:03:46,639 --> 00:03:47,560
is Burrowing Rat.

81
00:03:48,039 --> 00:03:49,479
The time Benefactor Li made his fortune

82
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:51,960
perfectly matches their disappearance.

83
00:03:52,879 --> 00:03:53,520
Burrowing Rat,

84
00:03:55,599 --> 00:03:56,759
where are your three brothers?

85
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:06,280
Let me tell you,

86
00:04:06,759 --> 00:04:07,960
500 years ago,

87
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:10,120
a Yuncang Kingdom prince named Qifeng...

88
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:11,360
Well, he

89
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:13,960
took his gold south to the Central Plains

90
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:14,960
to marry a princess.

91
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:17,720
But who knew that halfway there,

92
00:04:17,959 --> 00:04:19,639
he would suddenly fall ill and die?

93
00:04:21,079 --> 00:04:22,040
His followers

94
00:04:22,519 --> 00:04:24,519
buried all this gold with him.

95
00:04:24,879 --> 00:04:25,439
So,

96
00:04:25,639 --> 00:04:26,120
this place right here...

97
00:04:26,279 --> 00:04:29,439
is the Yuncang Kingdom's Golden Tomb!

98
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:30,800
I never imagined

99
00:04:30,959 --> 00:04:31,639
that the Golden Tomb

100
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:33,839
would be deep in Lijia Town's forests,

101
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:36,199
and the Four Bandits of Yanbei found it!

102
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:54,480
Help me!

103
00:05:20,399 --> 00:05:21,639
Elder Ding never imagined

104
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:23,720
that his act of kindness

105
00:05:24,439 --> 00:05:26,319
would bring about his own demise.

106
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:29,399
Chunmei and her brothers are the killers.

107
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:32,399
The three sisters are their accomplices.

108
00:05:33,360 --> 00:05:35,959
The six of them acted together.

109
00:05:37,279 --> 00:05:39,319
This is the truth of the Li mansion case.

110
00:05:40,399 --> 00:05:41,600
The so-called ghosts and spirits

111
00:05:42,439 --> 00:05:43,319
are nothing but rumors.

112
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:45,600
Chunmei,

113
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:46,439
Dazhu,

114
00:05:46,759 --> 00:05:47,199
Erzhu,

115
00:05:48,439 --> 00:05:49,480
you resorted to vigilantism

116
00:05:49,759 --> 00:05:50,519
instead of justice,

117
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:53,439
mistakenly killing the wives and Mengzhu.

118
00:05:54,279 --> 00:05:55,600
You've committed intentional homicide.

119
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:58,639
The three sisters scared people as ghosts,

120
00:05:59,319 --> 00:06:00,560
committing public intimidation.

121
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:02,720
To get revenge on Benefactor Li,

122
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:05,519
you killed so many innocent people.

123
00:06:06,199 --> 00:06:07,519
How are your actions

124
00:06:07,680 --> 00:06:09,560
any different from Benefactor Li's?

125
00:06:10,079 --> 00:06:11,319
You are Unforgivable.

126
00:06:11,839 --> 00:06:13,639
You must face the law.

127
00:06:14,439 --> 00:06:14,959
Officers!

128
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:17,000
Take them back to the station.

129
00:06:17,319 --> 00:06:17,800
Yes, sir.

130
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:21,639
Oh no.

131
00:06:22,079 --> 00:06:22,800
It's almost seven.

132
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:26,759
I have to report to the provincial bureau.

133
00:06:27,319 --> 00:06:28,439
I must beat my father to it.

134
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:33,199
Let's go.

135
00:06:35,199 --> 00:06:35,600
Hurry up.

136
00:06:52,639 --> 00:06:53,879
Hello, Director Wu.

137
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,680
Good morning, Director Wu.

138
00:06:56,319 --> 00:06:57,120
It's Mu Gui.

139
00:06:57,759 --> 00:06:58,600
I'm asking you

140
00:06:58,800 --> 00:07:01,680
to dismiss Lijia Town's Inspector,

141
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:02,759
Mu Ying, from her post.

142
00:07:03,759 --> 00:07:04,560
Mu Gui.

143
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:07,240
You're the one being dismissed.

144
00:07:08,879 --> 00:07:09,399
Director Wu.

145
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:11,800
I'm the one being dismissed?

146
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:13,120
There must be a mistake, Director Wu.

147
00:07:13,439 --> 00:07:13,920
Director Wu?

148
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:15,040
Director Wu!

149
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:15,720
Chief!

150
00:07:16,399 --> 00:07:17,639
From the Provincial Inspection Division.

151
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:18,199
They insisted on barging in.

152
00:07:18,319 --> 00:07:19,120
I couldn't stop them.

153
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:21,720
You guys from the Inspection Division,

154
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:23,079
what are you doing in Lijia Town?

155
00:07:24,079 --> 00:07:24,560
Mu Gui,

156
00:07:24,759 --> 00:07:26,560
By order of Director Wu,

157
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:28,720
you are suspended and under investigation.

158
00:07:29,439 --> 00:07:31,040
In Elder Ding's case, you're suspected of

159
00:07:31,439 --> 00:07:32,240
accepting bribes,

160
00:07:32,399 --> 00:07:33,120
dereliction of duty,

161
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:34,600
and letting criminals go free.

162
00:07:34,759 --> 00:07:36,079
During your suspension and investigation,

163
00:07:36,399 --> 00:07:38,480
your duties in Lijia Town are suspended.

164
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:40,439
Mu Ying will take over as Chief.

165
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:43,240
Mu Ying will get married to Benefactor Li.

166
00:07:43,319 --> 00:07:44,160
She can't be Chief.

167
00:07:44,959 --> 00:07:45,600
Besides,

168
00:07:46,319 --> 00:07:47,079
out of the blue,

169
00:07:47,160 --> 00:07:48,600
why is the provincial bureau suspending me?

170
00:07:48,839 --> 00:07:50,959
The one who reported your misconduct

171
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:51,839
was none other than Mu Ying.

172
00:07:51,959 --> 00:07:52,839
She asked me to inform you

173
00:07:53,079 --> 00:07:53,800
the wedding is canceled.

174
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:55,439
Benefactor Li is a criminal suspect.

175
00:07:56,160 --> 00:07:57,120
The Li mansion murder case

176
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:57,959
must still be investigated.

177
00:07:58,439 --> 00:07:59,759
Take him away. Mu Ying reported me?

178
00:08:01,079 --> 00:08:02,639
That's not right. That damn girl...

179
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:03,319
That's not right.

180
00:08:03,720 --> 00:08:04,040
That's not right!

181
00:08:04,079 --> 00:08:04,600
Let's go. Move it!

182
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:05,480
Mu Ying! Take him away!

183
00:08:05,759 --> 00:08:06,120
That's not right!
